OL,3,GNEWSAChildren's hospital entrance to
OL,4,Ashut overnight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's hospital is to lock its
OL,7,Fdoors overnight after incidents of
OL,8,Fpeople sleeping in the building or
OL,9,Ftrying to get into wards and clinical
OL,10,Funits.
OL,12,FHull Women and Children's Hospital will
OL,13,Frestrict access between 21:00 and 07:00
OL,14,Ffrom 7 September.
OL,16,FEntry will be available via a buzzer
OL,17,Fsystem with a red telephone in the
OL,18,Ffoyer allowing patients to call for
OL,19,Femergency help, Humber Health
OL,20,FPartnership said.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
